// Simulate `ota apply`: set the TAMP backup-reg apply flag, then reset into the
// bootloader so it runs the QSPI->app-slot copy. RCC/PWR pokes are undone by the
// reset; only TAMP_BKP0R (backup domain) survives a system reset.
si SWD
speed 4000
device STM32G474RE
connect
h
w4 0x40021058, 0x10000400
w4 0x40007000, 0x00000100
w4 0x40002500, 0x0A7A0A7A
r
g
qc
